# Default scripted touches for headless smoke tests and screenshots.
# Format: see docs/testing.md.   tap T SLOT X Y | hold T DUR SLOT X Y | drag T DUR SLOT X0 Y0 X1 Y1
#         wave T DUR SLOT CX CY R TURNS | down/move/up T SLOT X Y | fuzz T DUR N
tap   20 0 480 270
tap   40 1 300 200
tap   60 2 700 320
drag  80 50 0 200 400 760 200
drag  90 60 1 800 120 160 420
wave 140 90 2 480 270 140 1.5
hold 150 60 3 480 400
fuzz 200 100 10
